# Frontend build-time settings (Vite reads VITE_* vars).

# Tawk.to live-chat embed URL for the help widget's "Chat with a human" button.
# Get it from your Tawk.to dashboard: Administration -> Channels -> Chat Widget,
# copy the src from the embed snippet, e.g.
#   https://embed.tawk.to/<propertyId>/<widgetId>
# When blank, the button falls back to a support mailto link.
VITE_TAWK_SRC=

# Our own tracking ID, so trynobot.com is protected by TryNoBot. Create a
# website in the dashboard for this domain and paste its tracking ID here
# (st_...). Blank = the tracker doesn't load, which is the right default for dev.
#
# Deliberately loaded WITHOUT data-strict: strict mode hides the page until the
# verdict lands, and a blank homepage for up to 1.2s would cost more visitors
# than it saves.
#
# !! Do NOT create blocking Traffic Rules for this site. The tracker enforces
# verdicts in the browser, so a Block rule here would show our own visitors an
# "Access denied" page on our own marketing site. With no rules it only
# observes, which is what we want.
VITE_SELF_SITE_ID=
